---
title: "Exterior Care"
description: "Professional window cleaning, power washing, gutter maintenance, and wood rot repair for siding and trim."
ogUrl: services/exterior-care.html
root: "../"
active: "services"
ogImage: "https://property-care.pages.dev/images/after/yellow-house-after.webp"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Services"
    url: "/services"
  - name: "Exterior Care"
    url: "/services/exterior-care"
faq:
  - q: "How often should gutters be cleaned?"
    a: "Twice a year is standard for most Front Range properties — once in late spring and again after fall leaf drop."
  - q: "Can power washing damage siding or wood?"
    a: "Used incorrectly, yes. We adjust pressure and technique by surface — siding, deck wood, and stone all need different settings, which is part of why this is best left to a pro."
  - q: "Do you repair wood rot or just identify it?"
    a: "Both. We can handle minor to moderate trim and siding repairs directly, and we'll flag anything that needs more extensive replacement."
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  {% include "icons.njk" %}
  {% include "nav.njk" %}
<main id="main">

  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="section" style="padding-top:0; padding-bottom:0;">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="current">Exterior Care</span>
      </div>
      <p class="section-label">Service</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Exterior Care</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Professional window cleaning, power washing, gutter maintenance, and wood rot repair for siding and trim.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="/portfolio" class="btn-ghost">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICE DETAIL -->
  <section style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="service-detail-layout">
        <div class="service-detail-main" data-aos="fade-up">
          <p class="lead">Your home's exterior takes the brunt of Colorado weather year-round. Regular exterior care — clean gutters, washed siding, sealed wood trim — protects the building itself, not just its appearance.</p>

          <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">What's included</h3>
          <ul class="service-include-list">
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Interior and exterior window cleaning</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Power washing for siding, decks, and walkways</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Gutter cleaning and minor gutter repair</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Wood rot identification and trim repair</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Soffit and fascia inspection</span></li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-check"/></svg><span>Pre-winter exterior prep checklist</span></li>
          </ul>

      <div style="margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p class="section-label">From Our Portfolio</p>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; color:var(--bark); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Related projects</h3>
        <div class="related-portfolio-strip">
        <a href="/portfolio" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <img src="../images/after/yellow-house-after.webp" alt="Full exterior refresh including power washing and trim repair" loading="lazy" srcset="../images/responsive/after_yellow-house-after-480.webp 480w, ../images/responsive/after_yellow-house-after-800.webp 800w, ../images/responsive/after_yellow-house-after-1200.webp 1200w, ../images/after/yellow-house-after.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Yellow House</h5>
            <span>Exterior Care · Niwot, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/portfolio" class="related-portfolio-card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <img src="../images/after/lawn-after.webp" alt="Healthy lawn after restorative care" loading="lazy" srcset="../images/responsive/after_lawn-after-480.webp 480w, ../images/responsive/after_lawn-after-800.webp 800w, ../images/responsive/after_lawn-after-1200.webp 1200w, ../images/after/lawn-after.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw">
          <div class="related-portfolio-card-body">
            <h5>Lawn</h5>
            <span>Landscaping · Longmont, CO</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:1.5rem">
          <a href="/portfolio" class="btn-primary">View Full Portfolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="service-sidebar" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h4>Other Services</h4>
          <ul class="service-sidebar-list">
          {% for cs in services %}{% if cs.slug != page.fileSlug %}
          <li><a href="/services/{{ cs.slug }}">{{ cs.title }}</a></li>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Estimate</a>
          <div class="service-sidebar-contact">
            Call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" style="background:var(--straw);">
    <div class="section">
      <p class="section-label">Questions?</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Exterior Care <em>FAQs</em></h2>
      <div class="faq-container" data-aos="fade-up">
        {% for item in faq %}
        <div class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 100 }}">
          <button class="faq-trigger" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="faq-question">{{ item.q }}</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{{ item.a }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BADGES -->
  <section id="trust" style="background:var(--cream);">
    <div class="section" style="padding:3rem 2.5rem;">
      <div class="trust-badges">
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-shield"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Licensed & Insured</strong><br><small>Full coverage protection</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-star"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>5-Star Rated</strong><br><small>Serving local homeowners since 2014</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-people"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Local & Reliable</strong><br><small>Boulder County &amp; beyond</small></p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-badge">
          <div class="badge-icon"><svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-bolt"/></svg></div>
          <p><strong>Quick Response</strong><br><small>24-hour reply guarantee</small></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "area-links.njk" %}
{% include "cta-estimate.njk" %}
</main>
  {% include "footer.njk" %}
  {% include "scripts.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
